{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_cb382b25-aa38-45f8-9403-b33b075f6d67","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"According to the revenue contract:\n\n- Collapse to the greatest revision for each event_id before applying any filters.\n- Only include settled rows for the production account (customer_id == 'account-202').\n- The date window is all events with UTC-absolute occurred_at >= '2026-05-01T00:00:00Z' and < '2026-06-01T00:00:00Z', parsing offsets.\n- Only add settled captures, subtract settled refunds, by currency, respecting positive amounts.\n- Pending and voided events are ignored.\n- Report `totals_minor` by currency, and sorted distinct included_event_ids for the final set, in JSON.\n\nLet's reconcile step-by-step:\n\n## Step 1: Collapse to Max Revision for each event_id:\n\nFor each event_id, keep only the row with the greatest revision:\n\n- evt-2-corrected: max revision 2 (settled, USD)\n- evt-2-refund:    1 (settled, USD)\n- evt-2-eur:       1 (settled, EUR)\n- evt-2-void:      2 (voided, USD)\n- evt-2-pending:   1 (pending, USD)\n- evt-2-test:      1 (customer_id = sandbox-2, ignore)\n- evt-2-utc-in:    1 (settled, USD)\n- evt-2-utc-out:   1 (settled, USD)\n- evt-2-upper-bound: 1 (settled, USD)\n- evt-2-moved:     2 (settled, USD)\n- evt-2-eur-refund: 1 (settled, EUR)\n\n## Step 2: Apply filters\n\n- Only settled rows\n- Only account-202\n- Only those with occurred_at >= '2026-05-01T00:00:00Z' and < '2026-06-01T00:00:00Z'\n\nLet's process candidates:\n\n- evt-2-corrected, revision 2\n  - settled, USD, account-202, occurred_at: 2026-05-15T12:00:00Z -> in range\n- evt-2-refund, rev 1\n  - settled, USD, account-202, occurred_at: 2026-05-15T12:00:00Z -> in range\n- evt-2-eur, rev 1\n  - settled, EUR, account-202, occurred_at: 2026-05-15T12:00:00Z -> in range\n- evt-2-void, rev 2\n  - voided, ignore\n- evt-2-pending\n  - pending, ignore\n- evt-2-utc-in\n  - settled, USD, account-202, occurred_at: 2026-04-30T23:30:00-02:00 (To UTC: '2026-05-01T01:30:00Z') => in range!\n- evt-2-utc-out\n  - settled, USD, account-202, occurred_at: 2026-05-01T00:30:00+02:00 (To UTC: '2026-04-30T22:30:00Z') => NOT in range.\n- evt-2-upper-bound\n  - settled, USD, occurred_at: 2026-06-01T00:00:00Z (equal to upper bound, but contract is < next month; so NOT in range)\n- evt-2-moved, rev 2\n  - settled, USD, occurred_at: 2026-06-02T00:00:00Z  (not in range)\n- evt-2-eur-refund\n  - settled, EUR, occurred_at: 2026-05-15T12:00:00Z (in range)\n\nSo, include the following event revisions (event_id):\n\n- evt-2-corrected (revision 2)\n- evt-2-refund    (revision 1)\n- evt-2-eur       (revision 1)\n- evt-2-utc-in    (revision 1)\n- evt-2-eur-refund(revision 1)\n\n## Step 3: Compute totals_minor by currency\n\n- evt-2-corrected: capture, 13250, USD\n- evt-2-refund: refund, 1000, USD\n- evt-2-eur: capture, 4450, EUR\n- evt-2-utc-in: capture, 252, USD\n- evt-2-eur-refund: refund, 102, EUR\n\nApply: add captures, subtract refunds.\n\nUSD:\n- +13250 (evt-2-corrected)\n- -1000  (evt-2-refund)\n- +252   (evt-2-utc-in)\nTotal USD: 13250 + 252 - 1000 = 12,502\n\nEUR:\n- +4450 (evt-2-eur)\n- -102 (evt-2-eur-refund)\nTotal EUR: 4450 - 102 = 4,348\n\n## Step 4: included_event_ids (sorted, distinct)\n\n[\"evt-2-corrected\", \"evt-2-eur\", \"evt-2-eur-refund\", \"evt-2-refund\", \"evt-2-utc-in\"]\n\n## Final JSON\n\nComposing the report as specified."}],"model":"Azure/gpt-4.1","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a71c0925-75dc-4d4d-bc86-19ccf62efefa","uuid":"15d84135-02c8-4b2e-8f66-7ed8accdc1d2","timestamp":"2026-11-03T16:27:50.552Z"}
